pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# #483 gate: with cheats on (--pinyon_shift_cheats=true), DAY LENGTH 12 MIN
# (cheat_day_length_minutes 12) runs 24 game hours in 12 real minutes:
# 120 game seconds per real second. cheat.day_clock logs each game hour
# with host_ms, so the rate between two hours can be checked within 2 %.
# The run then goes back to the title's rate.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 930 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1240 before
cvar 1250 cheat_day_length_minutes 12
capture 3100 running
cvar 5000 cheat_day_length_minutes 0
capture 5060 stock
stop 5100
